# The published artifacts are CACHE, not source. They are byte-for-byte copies of
# files that already live in this repository (manage-windows-agent.ps1 at the
# root, the binary and its sidecars under agents/endpoint/windows/), so committing
# them here would duplicate a 4.5MB binary on every agent build and, worse, give
# the duplicate its own chance to drift from the original.
#
# The directory is populated one of three ways, any of which is enough:
#   * the manager refreshes it from the private repo   (AGENT_DIST_TOKEN set)
#   * the image build seeds it                          (.github/workflows/build-images.yml)
#   * an operator stages the files by hand              (air-gapped sites)
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
